{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>But you.</b> You too have accepted upon yourself." "<b>That you have gone astray under your husband, and that you have become defiled.</b> That the curse shall take effect on account of your having gone astray and become defiled, and not on account of any other cause. And when the cause is absent and untrue, there shall be no effectuation whatsoever to the words of the curse."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:38:42.947588765Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}